{"id":"vis-implement","parent":"perf-validate-incremental","ord":"a0","title":"incremental validator as SHADOW + divergence alarm + property test + open PR","done":"2026-08-25T01:45:09-04:00","desc":"Reported 01:44 (terminal f759fed5, 1h04m): PR #383. The incremental validator narrowed per model-indices.md:57, shipped as SHADOW — both arms per write, full authoritative, divergence → log + error-level. Property test ZERO divergences: 1,500 generated revisions (884 narrowed / 616 cold / 822 refused / 497 unreadable) + 121 vault revisions. Bench: keystroke 23.4ms→0.02ms narrowed; edge-add honestly all-three-walks; the both-arms shadow cost stated (writes pay more until the flip). The flip filed separately as perf-validate-flip (merge=HUMAN, empty-log ∧ ≥3 quiet nights, 7-day default-REMOVE). Two self-caught sweep folds at b6149e09. TIMING SLIP: started CI at implement (the brief said close) — the run may be superseded by review folds; noted, not interrupted. Grok review dispatched in parallel.","created":"2026-08-25T00:39:14-04:00","changed":"2026-08-25T01:45:09-04:00","custom":{"pr":"https://github.com/juspay/olai/pull/383","terminal":"f759fed5"}}
{"id":"vis-review-grok","parent":"perf-validate-incremental","ord":"a1","title":"review: grok (split)","done":"2026-08-25T01:57:53-04:00","desc":"grok, DO-NOT-FOLD (OBJECT), 1 MUST + SHOULD + NIT, at #383 (01:56, 10m40s, by reading, contract honored explicitly) — https://github.com/juspay/olai/pull/383#issuecomment-5406172956. THE MUST: the fold commit renamed the divergence log the process WRITES ($XDG_STATE_HOME/olai/validate-shadow.ndjson) but the FLIP'S MACHINE-CHECKABLE GATE still carried the log's OLD name with the banned extension (the pre-rename \".jsonl\" spelling) — a file this process never writes, so the gate would read absent-as-empty and green the flip vacuously; the same incomplete-rename class extension.test.ts exists to catch, unreachable by CI because of the roadmap grant. (This desc itself once quoted the old spelling verbatim and FAILED the #383 agreement pin on master — reworded 2026-08-25 08:17; the pin polices even the board's prose, which is the point.) Axes otherwise CLEAN with a per-rule table: duplicate-ids ask the gate again; parents/targets re-ask from the maintained maps; cycles whole-or-not-at-all on the tuple trigger; documents carry a complete delta keyed by path+fileKind (NOT the #382 membership-proxy shape — checked against it explicitly). The shadow cannot change control flow (void return, full ledger in finally, throws → why:threw, log-write failure shouts and does not rethrow — pinned). NIT: cold is one bucket for first-load/rebuild/unique-ids-decline.","after":["vis-implement"],"created":"2026-08-25T00:39:14-04:00","changed":"2026-08-25T08:16:59-04:00","custom":{"reviewer":"grok","terminal":"dc9ae548"}}
